      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GEORGE JUDY (1) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by a neck at Taree Super Track in a handy 17.33 beating Calla Naughty. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Can continue on his winning ways. LATE IN ARRIVAL (4) is progressing well scoring last time out (22.82) at this track and bringing up her 9th career win. Form here at the trip excellent including seven wins. Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. Sure to be thereabouts. SAIL AWAY SAM (2) boasts a consistent overall record including eight wins from 36 starts, the latest hitting the minor money when third (23.23) over 400m at this track. Has a good record here including five wins. Meets a moderate line up and should run well. ELLA KNOWS (3) was below best last time at this track (23.24) in a Free For All, finishing a 6 length fourth. Has already won two times from this draw.",
